; Brewing atlas.
; cauldron: iron pot 64x56. cauldron_liquid_0..2: bubbling liquid overlay on the same 64x56 canvas (same anchor),
; drawn only in v (white body, so modulate gives the exact colour), 9 (shade) and 7 (bubble rims); draw it over the pot
; with `modulate` set to the potion colour. fire_0..2: 32x16 flames on logs, centred under the pot's legs.
; ladle: 12x40 stir spoon, pivot at the bowl. bottle_<shape> (round, tall, flask, teardrop): 20x28 glass with a
; transparent interior, all sharing one canvas (neck x 7..12, lip rows 0..4, base on row 27). Draw it OVER
; bottle_<shape>_liquid, the matching neutral mask of the inner volume (rows 5..26); reveal it from the bottom to show
; the fill level and tint it with modulate (body v, shade 9).
; fill_line: 24x3 target marker, centred on the bottle. cork: 8x7, sits on the bottle neck (x 6..13).

